  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A rumor holds that Blood Sea Ancestor’s hundreds of thousands of inheritances were diversions, and that the true inheritances were only a few, holding his best Gu, research insights, or fusion recipes.",
      "chapters": [
        183
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blood_sea_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shang Yan Fei later restates the same gap: blood sea inheritances are almost uncountable, yet the true inheritances are hidden among them and hard to find even with clan investigation.",
      "chapters": [
        274
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_yan_fei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Eighty-Eight True Yang Building’s true inheritance secluded domain, Mo Yao says a ten-edge owner token can only receive the lowest grade ordinary true inheritance, and that Giant Sun true inheritances are not easy to obtain.",
      "chapters": [
        597
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ordinary-versus-unparalleled",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
        "char_mo_yao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She also urges Fang Yuan to use pure wills to probe secrets of unparalleled inheritances, which have much greater value than ordinary inheritances.",
      "chapters": [
        598
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unparalleled-value",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit says Thieving Heaven has many inheritances but only ten true inheritances. An earlier task to refine three Gu was not a true inheritance. Each Thieving Heaven true inheritance is an unparalleled treasure that holds the essence of that Demon Venerable’s cultivation, and the inheritor must be an otherworldly demon.",
      "chapters": [
        992
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "essence-of-a-venerable",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "inh_thieving_heaven_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Named true inheritances are listed on inheritances. Grade labels inside True Yang Building are covered on True Inheritance Grades.",
